  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-109348",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X$ and $Y$ are *independent* random variables, then\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X\\cdot Y]=\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y]\n$$\n\nSince $X$ and $Y$ are independent, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X\\cdot Y]=\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y]=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 10=5.\n$$",
